    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/bootstrap/process/Process_LogMessage",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Process",
      "label": "Log a message",
      "summary": "A SUB-PROCESS, never an entry point.",
      "description": "A SUB-PROCESS, never an entry point. Nobody starts here; it is reached by a call activity from a task in another process, which is why bootstrap's README still says there is one process you START.\n\nIt may be called OPTIONALLY from any task in any process — an actor logging what it is doing needs no permission — and a diagram may also REQUIRE it, which it says by drawing the call activity explicitly. The two are the same sub-process; the difference is whether the caller drew it.\n\nIt lives in bootstrap rather than in the harness on purpose. Bootstrap may not refer to a harness, so a logger defined upstream would be unusable by a Bootstrapping Agent — the actor with the most need to say what it is doing and the least machinery to do it with. Defined here, everything downstream inherits it.\n\nNO work-plan element, and isExecutable is false, for the same reasons as initialize-harness.",
      "source": "processes/log-message.bpmn",
      "depiction": "processes/log-message.svg",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/bootstrap/directory/processes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/bootstrap/process/Process_LogMessage#flow/SF_LM_1",
      "@type": "bootstrap:SequenceFlow",
      "sourceRef": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/bootstrap/process/Process_LogMessage/node/Start_LogMessage",
      "targetRef": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/bootstrap/process/Process_LogMessage/node/A_Compose",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/bootstrap/process/Process_LogMessage"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/bootstrap/process/Process_LogMessage#flow/SF_LM_2",
